     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts FRDataEntererLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"FRDataEntererLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"hcFRDataEntererLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-data-enterer</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-cda-data-enterer</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMDataEnterer</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>dataEnterer</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMDataEnterer.date</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>dataEnterer.time</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMDataEnterer.dataEnterer:healthProfessional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>dataEnterer.assignedEntity</td><td>L'opérateur de saisie professionnel de santé est de type FRLMHealthProfessional, cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMDataEnterer.dataEnterer:patient</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>dataEnterer.assignedEntity</td><td>L'opérateur de saisie patient/usager est de type FRLMPatient, cf. FRPatientLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 2 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-data-enterer</code> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/fhir-clinical-document/STU1.1/StructureDefinition-data-enterer-extension.html\">Data Enterer Extensionversion : 1.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMDataEnterer</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Extension (Data Enterer Extension)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMDataEnterer.date</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Extension.extension:time.value[x] (Value of extension)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMDataEnterer.dataEnterer:healthProfessional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x] (Value of extension)</td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x].resolve().ofType(PractitionerRole) — cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMDataEnterer.dataEnterer:patient</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x] (Value of extension)</td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x].resolve().ofType(Patient) — cf. FRPatientLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FRDataEntererLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FRDataEntererLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFRDataEntererLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-data-enterer</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/f